WEBVTT

01:29.570 --> 01:33.000
[Cage of Shadows]

01:33.620 --> 01:36.170
[Episode 2]

01:40.640 --> 01:41.759
Master.

01:42.610 --> 01:44.200
Why did you break in here without consent?

01:44.200 --> 01:46.720
Didn't I tell you to wait for me
and take care of your mother?

01:46.720 --> 01:48.120
I couldn't wait anymore.

01:48.479 --> 01:50.289
My mother's condition suddenly worsened.

01:50.289 --> 01:52.310
The doctor asked me
to fetch the antidote soon,

01:52.310 --> 01:54.310
or she might not survive this month.

01:56.360 --> 01:58.560
Only those on death row
would be brought to Lingya Tower.

01:58.560 --> 01:59.979
How did you sneak in here?

02:01.000 --> 02:03.460
The new top scholar was beheaded
and his body was discarded out of town.

02:03.460 --> 02:05.010
The killer hasn't been caught yet.

02:05.010 --> 02:07.260
I just turned myself in to the authorities

02:07.260 --> 02:08.250
and took the fall.

02:08.250 --> 02:08.870
Ridiculous!

02:08.870 --> 02:09.979
You didn't commit any offense,

02:09.979 --> 02:12.200
but everyone else in this tower
is a vicious criminal.

02:12.200 --> 02:14.200
-Do you know how dangerous...
-I know.

02:14.200 --> 02:15.280
You told me about it.

02:15.280 --> 02:15.880
Once in Lingya Tower,

02:15.880 --> 02:17.880
there are slim chances of survival.

02:19.600 --> 02:21.790
I'll try to find the antidote
as soon as possible.

02:21.790 --> 02:23.720
I'll also think of a way
to get you out of here.

02:23.720 --> 02:25.050
But I'm already in here.

02:29.040 --> 02:30.410
It's the eighth drum beat.

02:30.410 --> 02:32.270
The incense is almost burned out.

02:32.280 --> 02:33.240
You have to go now.

02:33.240 --> 02:34.620
The exit is right in that alley.

02:34.620 --> 02:35.480
Insert the key,

02:35.490 --> 02:36.670
and the door will open.

02:36.670 --> 02:38.530
Then you'll win this death match.

02:52.560 --> 02:53.990
What are you waiting for?

02:54.020 --> 02:54.860
Kill her now.

03:07.400 --> 03:08.640
Do it!

03:37.240 --> 03:38.140
Step back!

03:39.900 --> 03:40.960
Don't come near me!

03:43.160 --> 03:43.960
Watch out!

03:50.000 --> 03:50.720
Why not continue?

03:50.720 --> 03:51.650
I only brought one dart.

03:51.650 --> 03:54.110
I'll have to pull it out
if I am to use it again.

04:24.890 --> 04:25.530
Hold this.

04:27.220 --> 04:28.020
Take it.

04:33.690 --> 04:35.090
I, Dao, never use swords.

04:35.840 --> 04:37.500
They're clunky and of no help,

04:37.560 --> 04:38.720
just like men.

04:42.820 --> 04:44.020
Thanks for your help.

04:47.210 --> 04:48.870
I didn't come here to help you.

04:49.520 --> 04:51.380
The only reason I'm here is that this girl

04:51.380 --> 04:52.980
took the key to the exit door.

04:53.860 --> 04:54.580
Yanzhi,

04:54.610 --> 04:56.390
I was spotted by them when I just found

04:56.390 --> 04:57.550
the key in the alley.

04:57.840 --> 04:58.360
This is the key?

04:58.360 --> 04:58.880
Yes.

05:00.900 --> 05:02.300
It's the ninth drum beat.

05:02.970 --> 05:04.210
How could you do that?

05:04.240 --> 05:05.900
I thought you were on our side.

05:05.900 --> 05:07.300
Don't you know the rules?

05:07.680 --> 05:08.800
Only one of us

05:08.820 --> 05:10.330
can get out of here alive.

05:30.620 --> 05:32.159
It's true that only one can live,

05:32.159 --> 05:35.090
but obviously it's not the person
who opens the door.

05:41.920 --> 05:43.060
-Open up!
-Open the door!

05:43.060 --> 05:43.960
-Open the door!
-Open up!

05:43.960 --> 05:44.960
Open the door now!

05:55.460 --> 05:57.680
The bottom-level death match is over.

05:57.700 --> 05:59.360
You've passed the challenge.

06:16.250 --> 06:17.780
We've made it through.

06:18.840 --> 06:20.500
This is great, Yanzhi.

06:27.160 --> 06:28.220
Let's go.

06:33.680 --> 06:34.800
I finally made a right bet!

06:34.800 --> 06:35.760
Three survivors.

06:35.760 --> 06:37.290
Isn't it against the rules?

06:37.409 --> 06:38.260
Rules?

06:38.290 --> 06:39.880
Since when are there so many rules
in Lingya Tower?

06:39.880 --> 06:41.200
Now that all three girls
have made it through,

06:41.200 --> 06:43.260
the result should be deemed as valid!

06:43.530 --> 06:44.800
In that case,

06:44.800 --> 06:45.880
how do we settle the bets?

06:45.880 --> 06:48.240
Each of the two of you
bet right on one person.

06:48.240 --> 06:50.500
So you can split the prize money equally.

06:53.860 --> 06:54.810
Split it equally?

06:54.810 --> 06:56.110
Of course you're happy now.

06:56.110 --> 06:57.790
If these girls fight again,

06:57.840 --> 06:59.040
the one named Jiang Man who you bet on

06:59.040 --> 06:59.909
will definitely lose!

06:59.909 --> 07:01.150
What do you want then?

07:01.170 --> 07:02.760
Are we going to make them fight
another round?

07:02.760 --> 07:03.800
Yes, absolutely!

07:03.800 --> 07:04.560
For what reason?

07:04.560 --> 07:05.840
I already made the right bet.

07:05.840 --> 07:06.720
So did I!

07:06.720 --> 07:07.720
Harmony brings wealth.

07:07.720 --> 07:09.880
-Only one can be the winner.
-Harmony brings wealth.

07:09.880 --> 07:10.800
I have a proposal.

07:10.800 --> 07:11.830
Those girls

07:11.860 --> 07:14.380
are all beautiful and gorgeous.

07:14.400 --> 07:17.080
If the two distinguished guests of you
don't mind,

07:17.080 --> 07:19.720
why not go have a good time with them?

07:19.740 --> 07:21.140
Won't that be wonderful?

07:21.320 --> 07:22.520
Then send that girl

07:22.520 --> 07:24.210
with strong combat skills to me.

07:24.210 --> 07:25.000
Wujiu.

07:25.440 --> 07:26.120
Yes.

07:26.510 --> 07:28.200
You heard what we said, didn't you?

07:28.200 --> 07:29.400
Go make arrangements now.

07:29.400 --> 07:29.940
Yes.

07:32.630 --> 07:34.110
What's this place?

07:35.159 --> 07:36.000
Yanzhi,

07:36.080 --> 07:37.570
what does this mean?

07:39.720 --> 07:40.780
What's this smell?

08:02.160 --> 08:04.010
Here I come.

08:28.380 --> 08:30.830
You shouldn't have targeted these girls.

08:34.240 --> 08:36.299
[First Meeting]

08:41.150 --> 08:42.470
There's a rabbit.

08:56.680 --> 08:57.270
You...

08:57.390 --> 08:58.020
You...
